  "citation": "Brewer P G; Takahashi T; Williams R T (1986): Transient Tracers in the Oceans (TTO) - Hydrographic Data and CO2 Systems with Revised Carbon Chemistry Data. CDIAC. Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/OTG.NDP004",
